<title>SWEDEN: Sweden's Riksbank reverse repo drains 20 bln skr.</title>
<headline>Sweden's Riksbank reverse repo drains 20 bln skr.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swedish Rikbank said on Tuesday that it drained 20 billion crowns from the market in this morning's reverse repurchase operation.</p>
<p>The reverse repo was set at an unchanged fixed rate of 4.10 percent and will run from Janurary 15-22, replacing an operation that drained 21 billion crowns from the market.</p>
<p>The Riksbank said 4.65 percent of the bids for the tender were allocated.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1006</p>
